r because cards and tokens are never put into a player's graveyard.","oracle_id":"087f9ad7-e74f-40e2-8102-1ed2925d0418","published_at":"2018-03-16","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"The first ability can target any two lands. They don’t have to be tapped.","oracle_id":"186b4def-4fff-4a2b-bcbf-5318b0ac5fa9","published_at":"2009-10-01","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"The third ability affects only creatures you control at the time it resolves. It won’t affect creatures that come under your control later in the turn.","oracle_id":"186b4def-4fff-4a2b-bcbf-5318b0ac5fa9","published_at":"2009-10-01","source":"wotc"}],"schema_version":1,"source":"Scryfall Oracle/rulings subset for offline tests"}
